  "worked_solution": "The simple harmonic motion (SHM) equation is\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+{\\omega }^{2}y=0.\n$$\n\nIn our case\n\n$$\n{\\omega }^{2}=2\\,\u27f9\\,\\omega =\\sqrt{2}.\n$$\n\nThe period $T$ is given by:\n\n$$\nT=\\frac{2\\pi }{\\omega }\n$$\n\nTherefore, in our case, the period (in seconds) is\n\n$$\nT=\\frac{2\\pi }{\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\pi \\,\\text{s}.\n$$",
